# E2E ports (Librarian)

| Port | Role |
|------|------|
| **8793** | Product / Automat / local `python -m librarian.web` |
| **8794** | Mocked Playwright webServer (`npm run test:e2e`) |
| **8788 / 8790 / 8791 / 8792** | Sibling apps — **never** bind or document Librarian here |
| **8799** | Projectionist e2e default — **not** Librarian |

## Required behavior

- Default mocked e2e port is **8794** (`E2E_PORT` / Playwright config / `scripts/start-e2e-server.mjs`).
- Do not change the default to 8793 (clobbers product) or to Projectionist/sibling ports.
- Override with `E2E_PORT` / `E2E_BASE_URL` only when debugging — still avoid sibling ports.
- Locator standard, triad, cadence: [ui-testing-architecture.mdc](ui-testing-architecture.mdc).
